png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%B7%E5%85%B0\" title=\"荷蘭\">荷蘭</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%B7%E5%85%B0%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD\" title=\"荷蘭王國\">荷蘭王國</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%B7%E5%85%B0\" title=\"荷蘭\"><img alt=\"荷蘭\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Flag_of_the_Netherlands.svg/120px-Flag_of_the_Netherlands.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"67\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Flag_of_the_Netherlands.svg/250px-Flag_of_the_Netherlands.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Royal_coat_of_arms_of_the_Netherlands.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Royal_coat_of_arms_of_the_Netherlands.svg/120px-Royal_coat_of_arms_of_the_Netherlands.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"110\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Royal_coat_of_arms_of_the_Netherlands.svg/250px-Royal_coat_of_arms_of_the_Netherlands.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"952\" data-file-height=\"1045\" /></a></span></td>\n<td align=\"right\">17,291,000\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%B7%E8%98%AD%E8%AA%9E\" title=\"荷蘭語\">荷蘭語</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E5%A7%86%E6%96%